# Expected-hook manifest: the hooks that a woven build must have.
#
# Each line is: <go-minor> <goos>/<goarch> <hook>
# "*" matches all values. See internal/hookmanifest for the format.
#
# A change that adds a hook adds a line here, and adds a witness for the hook in
# witnesses.go. The sentinel fails when a line has no witness, or when its
# witness fails.
